cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the released results, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Complementary Behavior Representations for APT Evidence Recovery - code and archived results"
abstract: >-
  Compact code-and-results release for the paper "Complementary Behavior
  Representations for APT Evidence Recovery". It contains the nine-host
  Aggregate/Joint comparison over 27 paired detector runs, the archived
  Temporal-only summaries, the archived rule-sensitivity, paired-comparison and
  calibrated-rule tables, the detector, correlation, reporting and TGN-encoder
  code paths, and a stdlib-only script that re-derives every quoted number from
  the shipped CSVs.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous Authors (double-blind review copy)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/holdenli275/apt-evidence-recovery"
